--- EPUB/text/ch001.xhtml ---
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:epub="http://www.idpf.org/2007/ops" lang="und" xml:lang="und">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="generator" content="pandoc" />
  <title>ch001.xhtml</title>
  <style>
  </style>
  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../styles/stylesheet1.css" />
</head>
<body epub:type="bodymatter">
<section id="measuring-a-shared-path" class="level1">
<h1>Measuring a Shared Path</h1>
<p>The walking estimate is <math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
          <semantics>
            <mrow>
              <mi>d</mi>
              <mo>=</mo>
              <mi>v</mi>
              <mi>t</mi>
            </mrow>
            <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d = vt</annotation>
          </semantics>
        </math>. Với từng đoạn đường, ta có thể tính tổng như sau:</p>
<p>
        <math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
          <semantics>
            <mrow>
              <mi>D</mi>
              <mo>=</mo>
              <munderover>
                <mo>∑</mo>
                <mrow>
                  <mi>i</mi>
                  <mo>=</mo>
                  <mn>1</mn>
                </mrow>
                <mi>n</mi>
              </munderover>
              <msub>
                <mi>d</mi>
                <mi>i</mi>
              </msub>
            </mrow>
            <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">
D = \sum_{i=1}^{n} d_i
</annotation>
          </semantics>
        </math>
      </p>
<p>A slower pace changes the total time, not the map scale.</p>
</section>
</body>
</html>


